  <PWU_EnableMonoswordRecipeDesc>在“{1}”上显示“{0}”清单（需要“{2}”研究）。禁用此项只会将它从添加清单菜单中隐藏；已排入队列的清单仍会继续生产。</PWU_EnableMonoswordRecipeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enable plasmasword crafting recipe -->
  <PWU_EnablePlasmaswordRecipe>启用等离子剑制作配方</PWU_EnablePlasmaswordRecipe>
  <!-- EN: Show the "{0}" bill at the {1} (requires {2} research). Disabling this only hides it from the add-bill menu; bills already queued keep producing. -->
  <PWU_EnablePlasmaswordRecipeDesc>在“{1}”上显示“{0}”清单（需要“{2}”研究）。禁用此项只会将它从添加清单菜单中隐藏；已排入队列的清单仍会继续生产。</PWU_EnablePlasmaswordRecipeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enable zeushammer crafting recipe -->
  <PWU_EnableZeushammerRecipe>启用宙斯锤制作配方</PWU_EnableZeushammerRecipe>
  <!-- EN: Show the "{0}" bill at the {1} (requires {2} research). Disabling this only hides it from the add-bill menu; bills already queued keep producing. -->
  <PWU_EnableZeushammerRecipeDesc>在“{1}”上显示“{0}”清单（需要“{2}”研究）。禁用此项只会将它从添加清单菜单中隐藏；已排入队列的清单仍会继续生产。</PWU_EnableZeushammerRecipeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enable persona core crafting recipe -->
  <PWU_EnablePersonaCoreRecipe>启用人格核心制作配方</PWU_EnablePersonaCoreRecipe>
  <!-- EN: Show the "{0}" bill at the {1} (requires {2} research). Off by default: in vanilla a persona core can only be found or traded for, and crafting them makes persona weapons repeatable rather than rare. Turn this on for a fully self-sufficient in-colony path — craft a base weapon, craft a core, install it through customization. Disabling this only hides it from the add-bill menu; bills already queued keep producing. -->
  <PWU_EnablePersonaCoreRecipeDesc>在“{1}”上显示“{0}”清单（需要“{2}”研究）。默认关闭：在原版中人格核心只能靠寻找或交易获得，而能够制作它们会让人格武器从稀有变为可批量获取。若你想要一条完全自给自足的殖民地路线，可以开启此项——制作基础武器，制作核心，再通过定制把核心装入武器。禁用此项只会将它从添加清单菜单中隐藏；已排入队列的清单仍会继续生产。</PWU_EnablePersonaCoreRecipeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Persona core component cost: {0} -->
  <PWU_PersonaCoreRecipeComponentCost>人格核心的零部件成本：{0}</PWU_PersonaCoreRecipeComponentCost>
  <!-- EN: Advanced components required to craft one persona core. Takes effect immediately, no restart needed; queued bills are repriced too. -->
  <PWU_PersonaCoreRecipeComponentCostDesc>制作一个人格核心所需的高级零部件。设置立即生效，无需重启；已排入队列的清单也会重新计价。</PWU_PersonaCoreRecipeComponentCostDesc>
  <!-- EN: Persona core crafting skill required: {0} -->
  <PWU_PersonaCoreRecipeMinSkill>制作人格核心所需手工等级：{0}</PWU_PersonaCoreRecipeMinSkill>
  <!-- EN: Minimum Crafting skill a colonist needs to work the persona core bill. Setting this to 0 removes the skill requirement entirely. Takes effect immediately, no restart needed. -->
  <PWU_PersonaCoreRecipeMinSkillDesc>殖民者要执行人格核心清单所需的最低手工技能等级。设为0将完全移除技能要求。设置立即生效，无需重启。</PWU_PersonaCoreRecipeMinSkillDesc>

  <!-- Settings: Miscellaneous -->
  <!-- EN: Allow weapon def conversion -->
  <PWU_AllowDefConversion>允许武器形态转换</PWU_AllowDefConversion>
  <!-- EN: Allow weapons to convert between base and persona defs during customization. When disabled, only already-persona weapons can be customized, and removing all traits keeps the weapon as a zero-trait persona weapon instead of reverting to its base weapon. -->
  <PWU_AllowDefConversionDesc>允许武器在定制过程中于基础形态与人格形态之间转换。禁用时，只有已经是人格武器的武器才能被定制，且移除全部特性后武器会保持为没有特性的人格武器，而不会还原成对应的基础武器。</PWU_AllowDefConversionDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enforce trait count limit -->
  <PWU_EnforceMaxTraitLimit>强制执行特性数量上限</PWU_EnforceMaxTraitLimit>
  <!-- EN: Vanilla persona weapons generate with no more than two traits. Enable this to enforce the same limit during customization. Disable to allow any number of traits (other rules such as exclusion restrictions still apply). -->
  <PWU_EnforceMaxTraitLimitDesc>原版生成的人格武器最多带有两项特性。启用此项可在定制时沿用相同的上限。禁用则允许任意数量的特性（互斥限制等其他规则仍然生效）。</PWU_EnforceMaxTraitLimitDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enforce sole-trait restrictions -->
  <PWU_EnforceSoleTrait>强制执行唯一特性限制</PWU_EnforceSoleTrait>
  <!-- EN: Some traits cannot be the only trait on a weapon during vanilla generation. Enable this to enforce the same restriction during customization. -->
  <PWU_EnforceSoleTraitDesc>在原版生成过程中，某些特性不能作为武器上的唯一特性。启用此项可在定制时沿用相同的限制。</PWU_EnforceSoleTraitDesc>
  <!-- EN: Restrict available traits to discovered weapons -->
  <PWU_RestrictTraitsToDiscovered>仅提供已发现武器上的特性</PWU_RestrictTraitsToDiscovered>
  <!-- EN: A lightweight progression system: when enabled, the customization dialog only offers traits found on persona weapons the colony has seen: unfogged and unsealed on a loaded map, or carried in a player-faction caravan. Weapons carried by hostiles count too, but their traits stay disabled until the weapon is captured. No persistent state is added to saves; toggling this off restores the full trait list immediately. -->
  <PWU_RestrictTraitsToDiscoveredDesc>一套轻量的进程系统：启用时，定制界面只提供殖民地已经见过的人格武器上的特性，即已加载地图上处于已探明、未封闭区域的武器，或玩家派系商队携带的武器。敌人携带的武器同样计入，但在缴获之前它们的特性仍保持禁用。此功能不会向存档写入任何持久数据；关闭后会立即恢复完整的特性列表。</PWU_RestrictTraitsToDiscoveredDesc>
  <!-- EN: Enable ground weapon right-click menu -->
  <PWU_EnableGroundCustomization>启用地面武器右键菜单</PWU_EnableGroundCustomization>
  <!-- EN: Show "Customize" options when right-clicking weapons on the ground. Disable this to reduce float menu clutter, especially with storage mods that stack items in the same cell. Weapons can still be customized by selecting them and using the gizmo button. -->
  <PWU_EnableGroundCustomizationDesc>右键点击地面上的武器时显示“定制”选项。禁用此项可减少浮动菜单的杂乱，在使用会把物品堆叠到同一格的存储类mod时尤为有用。武器仍然可以通过选中它并使用界面按钮来定制。</PWU_EnableGroundCustomizationDesc>

  <!-- Settings: VEF texture-composition integration (only shown when the extended VEF reflection surface resolved) -->
  <!-- EN: Integrate VEF texture customization -->
  <PWU_IntegrateVpweCustomization>整合VEF贴图定制</PWU_IntegrateVpweCustomization>
  <!-- EN: Add a Texture tab to PWU's customization dialog for editing the composed appearance (grip, blade, and similar parts) of any persona weapon built on Vanilla Expanded Framework's texture composition — the weapons from Vanilla Persona Weapons Expanded, the Archoblade from Vanilla Races Expanded - Archons, and anything else using the same system. Also hides VEF's own separate "Customize" ground float-menu option wherever PWU's own customize option is available, giving you one unified place to edit a persona weapon instead of two competing menu entries. Enabled by default; disable this to keep the separate VEF workflow untouched. -->
  <PWU_IntegrateVpweCustomizationDesc>在PWU的定制界面中添加一个“外观”页签，用于编辑基于Vanilla Expanded Framework贴图组合系统的人格武器的组合外观（剑柄、剑刃等部件）——包括Vanilla Persona Weapons Expanded中的武器、Vanilla Races Expanded - Archons中的执政官之刃，以及任何使用同一系统的武器。此外，在PWU自身的定制选项可用之处，还会隐藏VEF单独提供的地面浮动菜单“定制”选项，让你在一个统一的位置编辑人格武器，而不是面对两个互相竞争的菜单项。默认启用；禁用此项可保持VEF原有的独立流程不受影响。</PWU_IntegrateVpweCustomizationDesc>

  <!-- Settings: Haul planner -->
  <!-- EN: Sequential -->
  <PWU_HaulPlannerSequential>顺序搬运</PWU_HaulPlannerSequential>
  <!-- EN: Vanilla behavior. Pawns carry up to one ingredient stack at a time, always grabbing the nearest first. Simple and predictable, but means lots of short trips for resource-heavy customizations. -->
  <PWU_HaulPlannerSequentialDesc>原版行为。角色每次最多搬运一堆材料，且总是先取最近的一堆。简单且可预测，但在材料需求量大的定制中会产生大量短途往返。</PWU_HaulPlannerSequentialDesc>
  <!-- EN: Sweep -->
  <PWU_HaulPlannerSweep>清扫搬运</PWU_HaulPlannerSweep>
  <!-- EN: Pawns plan ahead and use spare inventory space to carry more at once, while also routing more efficiently between pickups. Far fewer trips than Sequential, with negligible planning overhead. -->
  <PWU_HaulPlannerSweepDesc>角色会提前规划，利用剩余的物品栏空间一次搬运更多材料，同时在各个取货点之间选择更高效的路线。往返次数远少于顺序搬运，而规划开销可以忽略不计。</PWU_HaulPlannerSweepDesc>
  <!-- EN: Thorough -->
  <PWU_HaulPlannerThorough>彻底搬运</PWU_HaulPlannerThorough>
  <!-- EN: Like Sweep, but also weighs which stacks to draw from when the map has multiple candidates, rather than always taking the closest. Slower to plan, but usually finds the shortest runs when ingredients are scattered or carrying capacity is tight. Falls back to Sweep for hauls too complex to fully analyze. -->
  <PWU_HaulPlannerThoroughDesc>与清扫搬运类似，但在地图上存在多个候选堆时，还会权衡该从哪些堆中取用，而不是一律取最近的。规划较慢，但在材料分散或搬运容量紧张时通常能找出最短的路线。对于过于复杂、无法完整分析的搬运，会回退到清扫搬运。</PWU_HaulPlannerThoroughDesc>

</LanguageData>
